# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts
#
# main.pdf is NOT ignored: the bundled PDFs let a visitor see
# what each template produces without compiling anything.
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Every run leaves these
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

# bibtex
*.bbl
*.blg

# Table of contents, list of figures / tables
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot

# makeindex — the book template documents an index in \backmatter
*.idx
*.ind
*.ilg

# Editor <-> PDF sync. The (busy) file is left behind when a
# build is interrupted.
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex
*.synctex\(busy\)

# biber, if a document swaps natbib for biblatex
*.bcf
*.run.xml

# TikZ externalization, if \tikzexternalize is turned on
*.figlist
*.makefile
*.auxlock

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and operating system
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*~
*.swp
.DS_Store
._*

# Uncomment to keep VS Code settings out of the repo. Left
# tracked by default: a committed .vscode/settings.json is a
# convenient place for the latexmk-lualatex recipe.
# .vscode/
